WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:03.750
- We are here in the Emirates, in Dubai,

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.590
on my camel farm.

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:08.050
I am actually from Germany.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.090
It was never in my mind to breeding camel;

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:13.508
it just came by chance.

00:00:13.508 --> 00:00:15.950
(upbeat electronic music)

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.160
- Wherever I am in the world,

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.170
food is the focal point
of everything I do.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:23.590
My name is Ching, and I'm
a chef and food writer.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:26.320
My taste journeys have
taken me all over the world,

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:29.360
in search of great
flavors and new recipes.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.660
Finally, it has brought me to Dubai.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:34.920
And I can't wait to explore
its rich and varied food scene.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:35.913
One bite at a time.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:40.730
(curious electronic beat)

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:43.130
I've come to meet Uschi, a camel breeder

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:46.446
whose kept all the traditions
of Emirati flavors alive

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:47.279
year after year since moving
her from Germany in 1988.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.103
- Nice to have you here, nice.

00:00:52.008 --> 00:00:53.399
- How are you?

00:00:53.399 --> 00:00:54.900
- I am fine, fine.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.182
Welcome, welcome.

00:00:56.182 --> 00:00:57.015
- Thank you.

00:00:57.015 --> 00:01:00.070
- What I saw that time,
especially the city here in Dubai,

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:02.370
already it was very beautiful.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:04.900
Much different than to other countries.

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:07.760
You cannot have a better
place as a woman than here.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:10.350
Emirati culture is very respectful,

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:13.198
and very open-minded.

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:14.370
(gentle music)

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:16.400
First when I came as tourist,

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:19.930
I loved the country, I see,
I feel there is something.

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:22.750
In the early days I met this local family

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:25.310
and I fell in love with the family--

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:28.000
- So the Emirati culture is full of love,

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.171
I feel, and openness, and heart.

00:01:31.171 --> 00:01:34.020
- Yeah, and what the family give to me,

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:38.310
I give now to the people from outside,

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:39.870
and I want to give it to you.

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:41.679
- Thank you, that's amazing.

00:01:41.679 --> 00:01:43.599
That's amazing, thank you.

00:01:43.599 --> 00:01:45.784
(both laugh)

00:01:45.784 --> 00:01:50.010
- Many people have not the
chance to meet local people

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:52.520
and to know the real tradition,

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:55.930
and that's why I love being a host,

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:57.470
and people who coming to me,

00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:00.760
they keep me going and going and going.

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:01.990
- Hello, he's hungry. (laughs)

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:02.990
He's found the food.

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:10.500
- This is the big grains,
this also al ain dates.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:13.403
This is like dessert to him.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.240
- Forget the main course,
he's got a sweet tooth.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:19.170
- Yeah, not getting too much.

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:21.570
- [Ching] So, their meat
is really prized, isn't it?

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:25.100
- Yes, it's the lowest
cholesterol of any kind of meat,

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:29.283
and also very low fat,
much lower than cow.

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:33.380
Emirati families, if they
not have camel for raising

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:36.240
or for competition, they will not sell it,

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:39.410
but they will have it
for the whole family.

00:02:39.410 --> 00:02:40.243
- [Ching] I see.

00:02:40.243 --> 00:02:44.410
- See, you can touch the
nose, how soft, like handsome.

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:46.870
- Oh, hello sweetheart.

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:48.640
She's gorgeous.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.880
What I learned from Uschi is

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:53.830
that it's about using very
simple, humble ingredients,

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:55.480
but cooked with love,

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.940
each with its different traditions,

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:01.373
to really give you that
Bedouin and desert experience.

00:03:02.659 --> 00:03:04.883
I've just broken it, I've just broken it.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:10.060
Yeah, it's okay?

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:12.595
(man speaking foreign language)

00:03:12.595 --> 00:03:13.545
Ooh, it's hot, hot.

00:03:14.434 --> 00:03:16.243
Mmm, that is really good.

00:03:18.216 --> 00:03:19.049
(man speaking foreign language)

00:03:19.049 --> 00:03:21.233
I think I'm hired. (laughs)

00:03:21.233 --> 00:03:23.030
- My earliest memory of cooking,

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:26.710
the using different spices
and different preparing.

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:30.184
I eat my first goat leg here.

00:03:30.184 --> 00:03:31.340
(spices sizzling in pan)

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:34.440
It needs two hours before
to make the fire ready,

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.640
an the preparation in between,

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:38.890
and then two hours to cook it.

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:40.190
This makes the difference.

00:03:41.666 --> 00:03:44.249
(Arabic music)

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:48.070
- [Ching] The goat was amazing.

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:51.300
Such a simple, but humble, ritual;

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:55.460
it tasted so good; I
loved every minute of it.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:59.100
- [Uschi] We have here
la hambush, camel meat.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:02.430
In the spices it's just
simple salt and black pepper.

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:04.803
- Mm, that is so good.

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:08.530
The fact that people have
been sitting in the desert

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:12.050
for thousands of years like
this, it's so beautiful.

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:14.760
I've had such a magical day.

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:18.190
- Yes, I hope so, and you
are a wonderful guest.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.310
- [Ching] Oh, thank you, Uschi.

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:22.080
Uschi is the queen of the desert,

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:25.990
who knows that her heart
belongs here in Dubai.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:28.960
She is a true Bedouin, a free spirit.

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:32.210
And she knows how to really deliver

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:33.893
Emirati hospitality.

00:04:35.432 --> 00:04:38.099
(Arabic music)

